{"about_the_game":"The soundtrack reflects the specific atmosphere of the game's various neighborhoods and locations. Each piece uses themes inspired by the inhabitants, the features or the general mood of the places you are visiting as you explore the game's world. They vary in tempo and orchestration according to these specificities, although the set of instrument is purely orchestral and vanilla (no FX or ship horns in here).<br><br>Some songs were composed for specific in-game events and are timed accordingly to what happens in the story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590650/extras/4511b499cb008c87fee60b4f98f88816.avif?t=1695413608\" width=600 height=854 /></span><br><br>Titles are slightly cryptic but could also be remotely spoilery, so those who hate spoilers should finish the game before enjoying the OST.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590650/extras/12de752fa885421e032b3cfd0d4291b1.avif?t=1695413608\" width=600 height=338 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2590650?t=1695413608","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2590650?t=1695413608","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1695413608","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590650/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1695413608","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"The soundtrack reflects the specific atmosphere of the game's various neighborhoods and locations. Each piece uses themes inspired by the inhabitants, the features or the general mood of the places you are visiting as you explore the game's world. They vary in tempo and orchestration according to these specifici